Source: scst
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: StarlingX Developers <starlingx-discuss@lists.starlingx.io>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), linux@KERNEL_TYPE@-headers-stx-amd64, linux@KERNEL_TYPE@-keys
Standards-Version: 4.5.1
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: scst@KERNEL_TYPE@
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, scst-common
Description: SCST iSCSI target kernel modules for StarlingX
 This package provides the scst, scst_vdisk, and iscsi-scst Out-of-Tree
 kernel modules for the SCST iSCSI storage gateway. These modules enable
 SCSI-3 Persistent Reservations (PR) capable shared disks for Windows
 Server Failover Clustering (WSFC).

Package: scst-common
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: SCST common configuration files for StarlingX
 This package provides the common configuration files for the SCST
 iSCSI target kernel modules. It includes the modules-load.d configuration
 for auto-loading SCST modules at boot.
